# Production image input is a tested static build, not the development checkout.
# CI builds dist before invoking Docker. No credentials, raw archive, Git history,
# dependencies or test reports are sent to the Docker build context.
**
!dist/
!dist/**
!ops/
!ops/containers/
!ops/containers/**
!Dockerfile
!LICENSE
!DATA_ATTRIBUTION.md

# These remain excluded even if mistakenly placed in an allowed build folder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials.json
**/kubeconfig
**/kubeconfig.*
**/acme.json
**/*.tfstate*
